    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Google Forms\"\nicon: \"workspace_forms\"\n---\n\nI want to use Google Forms in this app. You **MUST** use the Google Workspace Skill for this integration."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Google Keep\"\nicon: \"workspace_keep\"\n---\n\nI want to use Google Keep in this app. You **MUST** use the Google Workspace Skill for this integration."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Google Meet\"\nicon: \"workspace_meet\"\n---\n\nI want to use Google Meet in this app. You **MUST** use the Google Workspace Skill for this integration."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Contacts\"\nicon: \"workspace_people\"\n---\n\nI want to use Contacts in this app. You **MUST** use the Google Workspace Skill for this integration."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add database and auth\"\nlogoUrl: \"https://www.gstatic.com/mobilesdk/250721_mobilesdk/mono_firebase_dark.svg\"\n---\n\nYou MUST connect the app to Firebase. Add functionality that uses Google Sign-in with Firebase Auth to securely identify users, and add data persistence to keep track of user data with Firestore."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Animate images into video\"\nicon: \"movie\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add the ability for users to upload a photo and then generate a video using Veo video generations. Use model: veo-3.1-fast-generate-preview, the generated video must have an aspect ratio of `16:9` (landscape) or `9:16` (portrait)."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Use Google Maps data\"\nicon: \"google_pin\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add Maps Grounding to the app where relevant to get up to date and accurate information. Use gemini-3.5-flash (with googleMaps tool)"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Generate high-quality images\"\nicon: \"image\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add image generation to the app using model gemini-3-pro-image-preview and provide an affordance for the user to specify the image size (1K, 2K, and 4K)."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add a Gemini chatbot\"\nicon: \"voice_chat\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add a multi-turn chat interface to the app using Gemini. The chat must maintain conversation history, display messages in a scrollable thread, and include a system instruction to give the chatbots specific roles. Use gemini-3.1-pro-preview for particularly complex tasks, gemini-3.5-flash for general tasks, and gemini-3.1-flash-lite for tasks that should happen fast."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Control image aspect ratios\"\nicon: \"aspect_ratio\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add image generation to the app and provide an affordance for the user to specify the aspect ratio (1:1, 2:3, 3:2, 3:4, 4:3, 9:16, 16:9, and 21:9). Use gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview for general cases, or gemini-3-pro-image-preview where studio-quality images are required."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Analyze images\"\nicon: \"document_scanner\"\n---\n\nAllow app users to upload a photo and then analyze it using Gemini. You MUST add image understanding to the app using model gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add low-latency responses\"\nicon: \"bolt\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add low-latency responses to the app using model gemini-3.1-flash-lite"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Enable high thinking\"\nicon: \"network_intelligence\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add thinking mode to the app where relevant to handle users\' most complex queries. You MUST use the gemini-3.1-pro-preview model and set `thinkingLevel` to `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`. Do not set `maxOutputTokens`."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      text: "do reserch for free open srce ui for agents swam\n"
    }
  }
