      title: "github.com"
    }
    summary: "Several open-source projects on GitHub provide user interfaces (UIs) or visualization tools for managing and observing agent swarms within multi-agent frameworks.\n\nSome notable examples include:\n\n*   **PicoAgents (part of `victordibia/designing-multiagent-systems`)** offers a Web UI that allows users to discover agents, orchestrators, and workflows. This UI provides features like streaming chat, a live debug rail, and a recorded run history.[1]\n*   **LangGraphics** is a visualization tool designed for LangGraph-based agent orchestration frameworks. It helps in visualizing the live execution of agents, making it easier to understand execution paths, branching conditions, loops, and potential issues.[2]\n*   **Agency Swarm (`VRSEN/agency-swarm`)** is a multi-agent orchestration framework that includes both a Web UI (`agency.copilot_demo()`) and a Terminal UI (`agency.tui()`) for interaction and demonstration.[3]\n*   **CoDA (`google-research/agentic-visualization`)** is a multi-agent framework focused on turning natural language queries into publication-quality visualizations, offering a unique approach to understanding agentic systems.[4]\n*   **Agent UI (part of `amd/gaia` discussions)** is envisioned as a control plane for multi-agent systems, providing a platform for users to view all active tasks across agents, with each task having its own conversation window for full observability and interaction.[5]\n*   The **OpenAI Agents SDK**, a production-ready evolution of the experimental Swarm project, features built-in tracing capabilities to help visualize and debug agentic flows.[6]\n*   **VoltAgent (`VoltAgent/voltagent`)** is an AI Agent Engineering Platform built on an open-source TypeScript AI Agent Framework. It enables the creation of intelligent agents with memory, tools, and multi-step workflows, supporting sophisticated multi-agent systems with supervisor coordination.[7]\n\nOther frameworks like `kyegomez/swarms`[8] and `microsoft/agent-framework`[9] provide robust multi-agent orchestration capabilities, and while they may have underlying mechanisms for monitoring, the snippets do not explicitly detail a dedicated, general-purpose UI. Additionally, curated lists such as `EvoMap/awesome-agent-swarm`[10] and GitHub topics like \"multi-agent-system\"[11] can serve as valuable resources for discovering more projects in this domain.\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJXHAnbQ4TVrn0ZwJ4UxRZb18_XGqgoQE1Gtf7l_5S-1jLDsrSg_BLiherd6G33hRmA21kyz0_8dXbnwRafbyJKXEd7tIug-AMvkx0NbyE8DjN8V4hRdJDTFcNqKmUhlBtIwpngOWiDO6js-8phuwtQqKEIsoX)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH_wd6t4ak0ML5Dxqx1V3y3rqQKFrzJcAtjiWdZnbWRCvkk0746sH4Y9U3tlw-guSpunKcB6CIVrCEyDMvWC3bwAeBNNlkSMn7W2b9Dayh63Zw19uWpLnAchjwOUtwTpc3hRvh9tm9vn60w)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHfRBMjqRbfeA7hAqW9sq0LIbpuDfB70MwT3wMlm3NECVLysRpOwl9o-l2my-HS8jn33cZnicryKERtxBBPQe8jfOlr7F2iINRaBnht1sYQzKPE6DRV-gIaMVxLeZa2IXw=)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFZc5Jru5VKnDkXB1fNW8RtCm1wBko4FYYdYYW4IzEqrWCoNbuW9JxJmQ64uQcNH_QGbkHFjT3GdH3d9dzAC5fX-eKklTpTE1NOwUjM-c3c2MUctcysuGLvmvWWWCzZlUtfb8iF2U-tr9o_rBsayU5NfT4m)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF5DMDA3N1m6ZDiVhaN1EhTW_lmpITvEFdSncneM1vofxjZYIVkZHPyWGFKIk877w6kA-dsd529QtOMVEwS6XTzK5i4vME4jSXm-M_aBZi-AFHu_55AIny9yZ1EVDBONKtk)\n[6] [github.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGmwIrPmNMdQ4MdzoPRwFD-EJttw1qEC29ysLoTsj5fuVrY1ViE-M516oFRByg0LB0yO-MorQPi0bHy3-_FTo2rt90mOj9knwV-INc2WW2TFn8VBLTH02O4tEaW901BOQTB3p2ej_S2HPE=)\n[7] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEC97f53MHVRaHu3l0FtQll7LKG9rf7iMSRuUrPc4X2ut-gJmwKgl1aeqixSdQW_Qd2FBl0j3z69MYh4GiB3xLfYTEY00PSW1DbufUag2kqQYqfFFdE9e9y9uaztpRDUi1L)\n[8] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEFkEfKIAdEN0lS5atQWBzQFZm0ALD-yuxINaznuKBqXNrZGUKJIxSzgMlFSNHU1rHCybIWg65Pp2v_iFlcdowRM0Fk2rNXdRSrkqv8uec5EhtPHA6JI75OBzuK7lQ=)\n[9] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG2CfxgXLNqA3DsQnNbGH2umn1viYU-WyazgnrY0pwRrdXe7hU0XStpX7t1gryKaur6uROvJoo9gx29NwPNiflmah9eSmHMB20xITAEmOpgrRNMfEYE6QGRatzNKNT5d7HN54hnFm5Z)\n[10] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFe8u6GPZ8X-TxnwaXn9WUUMHYThsKR_6Vw54pmNXnoE6T2W-Ze8wjc99NsrjvH4nEQ_kdFdfu0fWsJWwy4A3ECTcufVjT1Km8iiOn4D_cAh6eApLlwtlX5Kev1YNkpMMHdHrYJ8WkB3g==)\n[11] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsRtdSdjlQwm71gTEWQ3h0nNKAx4NimdP3ZaFUZE29pBE_ziJKYB4S-eKl4DkYqspJETJLmPRwEy7AmGB3ev-fTR4m-KPo4BVP7VbZ4SRA6FXfPIsYmMhlBrXjE0ZCafJbR-4whcPo)"
