      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEjolMA_qyj_No2iwHZwZBfcYWvGAvvGd0UOvG8_bP7XoAyca7D_ja8PL9tI_QAP3x99MW59XJrwXNcpRlFmfHcYtwOWxqkMfu9PDP_A_EXvxaxZV2NKYw="
      title: "github.com"
    }
    summary: "Here\'s a summary of open-source GitHub projects that offer UIs for building and managing agent swarms, including the projects you mentioned:\n\n**1. Swarms**\nSeveral projects fall under the \"Swarms\" nomenclature, primarily focusing on multi-agent orchestration:\n*   **AgentSwarms-fyi/agentswarms**: This is a self-hosted, source-available platform that provides a visual canvas for designing and running multi-agent swarms. It supports building agents, running multi-agent workflows, and inspecting execution traces on your own infrastructure.[1]\n*   **VRSEN/agency-swarm**: An open-source (MIT licensed) framework for building multi-agent applications, it extends the OpenAI Agents SDK and offers both a Web UI and a Terminal UI for creating, orchestrating, and managing collaborative AI agent swarms.[2]\n*   **openai/swarm**: This is an educational, open-source framework managed by the OpenAI Solution team that explores ergonomic and lightweight multi-agent orchestration, focusing on agents and conversation handoffs.[3]\n*   **penberg/swarm**: This project is a workspace manager for parallel coding agent development, featuring a native GTK desktop app and a CLI for managing repositories, isolated worktrees, and persistent terminal sessions. While it manages \"swarms\" of coding agents, its UI is a desktop application rather than a web-based agent design canvas.[4]\n*   **The-Swarm-Corporation/swarms**: Described as an \"Enterprise-Grade Multi-Agent Orchestration Framework,\" it aims to provide robust infrastructure for deploying and orchestrating agents and is open-source.[5] The associated \"Swarms AI\" emphasizes open collaboration and provides GitHub repositories for multi-agent AI systems.[6]\n\n**2. Flowise**\n**FlowiseAI/Flowise** is an open-source platform that enables users to build AI agents and workflows visually using a drag-and-drop interface.[7][8][9] It is built on the LangChain architecture and supports the creation of multi-agent systems.[10][9] Flowise features a React-based frontend for its UI.[7] However, it\'s important to note that Flowise announced it is winding down operations, with its GitHub repository transitioning to public archive status on August 10, 2026, and official core-team support ceasing on August 31, 2026.[9]\n\n**3. Langflow**\n**langflow-ai/langflow** is a powerful, open-source platform designed for building and deploying AI-powered agents and workflows.[11][12] It offers a visual authoring experience, an interactive playground for testing flows, and supports multi-agent orchestration.[11][13] Workflows can be deployed as an API or exported as JSON for Python applications.[11]\n\n**4. Dify**\n**langgenius/dify** is an open-source platform for developing LLM-powered AI applications, known for democratizing AI agent development through its no-code and intuitive interface.[14][15] It provides a visual canvas for designing and testing AI workflows, offering capabilities to define agents based on LLM Function Calling or ReAct, and integrate various pre-built or custom tools.[16][15]\n\n**5. OpenHands**\n**OpenHands** is an open-source platform focused on cloud coding agents, providing an \"Agent Canvas\" that allows users to run autonomous agents that plan, write, and apply changes across codebases.[17][18][19] The Agent Canvas is powered by the OpenHands Agent Server, a REST API for running multiple agents, and integrates with various tools like Slack and GitHub.[17][18]\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEYv5DBLnOTxZCZnK1XxIQyDy_263Gop0nJX1mb0OhO3G7Nzc_W_bC8AaqxipiTyaGj46R3cj_u97CfWWHBTfiywoP-kBMWz56msfxQp_nIyl8iUp1dJySxoiAgMGjP7Dr9KGQB7swiRXQ=)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFPhat8s1-jWV-fVhJ2BU3XHVQFXeqcVE-FfcJlvpnRE4fWqsHq1Ib7ESuBs7Bmrz0rxkYIczvE5wRMWtgYTWil3cFXyap1mSqsqXu46YwYii2aTfhvALE3Hsl9083S668=)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJODJgbITnV5ikAF_mYY5gFRHlLSQRCT267Lie4mVbXQ0W3Vxkuotk7fzEw5DvygGeVVUk9zksWRR8EOQd2NZcemiwqDVDwx5vARiNR-mbsxFDk7B2rvmVcl8=)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHy9vRJRCTMqlHsQ8zlJA8kx84QN0n2tTzR-feLsb6ig0xJ33-auLHN4W-sS-wl6HCj7iAjitqsDRPOZMEo1_N07pErgmyHcgoQI-i7eoGWGenrx2C-dLkzubAJ)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGOtCGM1n6Dkbs5DOgo9Kmd-QfyA84-e6enEwvJKoSj9yQguBVenLxzSMzLl4dMwLxq-mnYv_jBiF3jPhoTVxjzUqO9ln12feNaNxE1YnNBwer9-MR6hhqMtalPmAE=)\n[6] [swarms.ai](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHOD6ve1VkTOJXw5jhvxQyAqBrmahKUdN9Q94VwhMsUFtzkmrpp0tVa4ssHk3u01B3eB9QB_LdWRZWcZZ46_TPpWkIQ1w65pRPNsMrdaVDzC6LVaTiIiOzLbGRK0A==)\n[7] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHkYPeSlzNTzn7chskBlLLPqf77KKXbrALjKsxBP5A3Tc80ByAYkOK-hur1XARAuS2EGzMWwYAfxRy4WkOlAakg5HpqZ0Tp6gIk0JVfQ6AEUIUj-42cXN1cNnZn1MmMOg==)\n[8] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGroAQACfOm5E3pqB_jbJfRhmgcokp0JTLE7bdIrqBDSWWjdOdtCXj_BlcN4Rk0nZtNzF2w4r5nGyBvN_6QaNCX6Aw4pQr1PoHupzovThgRb1N92yfy5DX4jHbNCMcpqOvYbdiH-rQ=)\n[9] [seaflux.tech](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE6KdmvTUk8lWtKetWrHhtWYdyvgHKok7SL3D9nP1WaQjb19ZaJw1T74WeLgXWz2L8hlvfEZYBTHTqNSoJLa-u58KqNifeE9ysbrOoBCFtUGOmIIG0NjGu4J9CBq6vzA_LKOxRasFxcGPdHra2zzqUx6iZEqfvKp2-HJ1mqbw==)\n[10] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEkowOd1yJShMGggZKrT4_qUOe5YhCKMJdN3dADBKSDmSknLgGIG11-45xICJRGdJxPJmc5wqb74CNgi6axNMxtsaUDQLOzkhG32GC3ZycVk0PNE-Gbr0Wv-JuQ1vdTvc2iYlFREBMGqaucV76HfEs3bRLo_5zan2Vk0gCXdmQ3CBE5IISeg1SxWgyiDR5qTcntyXOH8yWtsrHb)\n[11] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG87yn6ZfPT6Y7_kLSJP2BLfEeLi9pJDYU8QuOmjGH-a9cBnGga8SxOX7jb-ma4CTm_CuK-veBH4cLk3sbxh2kRxo94KQGp2JPB6pcCDUMBdvhPt4hlS