  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing UI Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently digesting the user\'s UI request, specifically the desired counter design. The provided screenshot clarifies the need for a top tab bar featuring a sidebar toggle, back/forward navigation, and a representation of open tabs, each with a chat icon. I\'m focusing on dissecting these components to understand their functionality and visual attributes for accurate implementation.\n\n\n**Defining Tab and Sidebar**\n\nI\'ve moved on to solidify the specifics of the tab bar and the left sidebar. The tabs include \"AI Agent Tutorial\" with a chat icon, a \"New Chat\" tab (active), and a \"+\" button for adding more. The sidebar now incorporates a Littlebird logo with a toggle, \"New Chat\" (with an active state), \"Search\", \"Meeting Notes\", \"Routines,\" a \"Projects\" section with folder organization and add functionality, the \"Update ready\" card, a context indicator, and the user profile at the bottom.\n\n\n**Constructing Input Interface**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the input container\'s details. I\'m visualizing a clean, rounded border box with a specific background color and a text area for \"Ask Littlebird.\" The bottom row needs a \"+\" for attachments, a model selection dropdown (\"Max \342\214\265\"), a microphone icon for voice input, and a send button. I\'m also considering a Connected Apps Bar, offering users real-time integration with various apps via authentic icons and live data sync modals; I\'m working out the details on integrating them.\n\n\n**Integrating Connected Apps**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the Connected Apps Bar\'s integration within the input interface. I\'m prioritizing direct integration of apps like Google Drive, Google Calendar, Notion, and others, indicated via authentic icons and live data sync modals. My plan involves offering real-time integration features through these icons. Users can connect accounts, view synced data, and trigger real connector actions with this real-time app integration. Furthermore, I\'m considering Quick Prompt Pills like \"How is my data protected?\" and \"What are your capabilities?\" to further boost functionality.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 309267447
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
