  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining UI Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into crafting the precise user interface, mirroring that Littlebird screenshot. I\'m focusing on dissecting the required components. First up, I\'m examining the brand and application icons, specifically the `/src/components/ConnectorIcons.tsx` module. I am eager to consider real-world examples.\n\n\n**Gathering App Icons**\n\nI\'ve been gathering authentic SVG brand logos, prioritizing those found in the Littlebird screenshot, including Dropbox, Google Calendar, and Asana. My list is now complete, and I\'ve started organizing the specific file locations for each logo. I\'m focusing on the component that calls the icons, specifically `/src/components/ConnectorIcons.tsx`. I am also focusing on creating an accurate Littlebird bird icon.\n\n\n\n**Defining App Functionality**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the app\'s key features, starting with the UI elements. I\'m focusing on features such as \"Search,\" \"Meeting Notes,\" and \"Routines.\" Next, I\'m working on the \"Projects\" section with an expandable folder system, an \"Update Ready\" card, and a context-enabled indicator. Finally, I\'m creating the user profile area, featuring an avatar, plan info, and an upgrade trigger. I\'m prioritizing the overall experience. I\'m now transitioning to the design and implementation of the interactive connector modal and drawer.\n\n\n**Detailing Connector Status**\n\nI\'m now detailing the connector status indicators. My recent focus is on showing connection status, synced item counts, and the last sync time. I\'m moving on to building a view of synced files/items/events with search and filter functionality. Next up, I need to create a \"Connect / Authenticate\" form with mock inputs for API tokens or OAuth. I\'m also including a \"Sync Now\" button with a spinner and a \"Disconnect\" button.\n\n\n**Designing Connector Integration**\n\nNow I\'m designing the connector integration experience! I\'m focusing on the prompt to \"Connect your apps to get better answers,\" along with the associated icons for Dropbox, Google Calendar, and other integrations. I\'m incorporating dismiss buttons and hover tooltips for connector details and sync actions. Plus, I\'m integrating suggested prompt pills like \"How is my data protected?\" and \"What are your capabilities?\".\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Modeling Conversational Flow**\n\nI\'m now modeling the conversational flow. I\'m focusing on crafting the user message bubbles in a clean, dark style. I\'m making sure Littlebird responses feature step-by-step tool execution badges, rich markdown, web citations, and buttons for copy, regenerate, and share. I\'ve also implemented the pinned prompt box at the bottom for fluid conversation.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 13
      nanos: 497413976
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
