    thinking: "**Constructing ConnectorDrawer**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the interactive `ConnectorDrawer.tsx`. It will serve as both a Modal and Drawer for the ten real connectors: Dropbox, Google Calendar, Google Drive, Asana, Linear, Notion, Slack, Discord, Zapier, and GitHub. A key feature will be the ability to search across all connected items.\n\n\n"
