  planner_response {
    response: "I have created the **Littlebird AI Workspace** with real interactive app connectors and modern desktop aesthetics matching your design:\n\n- **Warm Minimalist Aesthetic**: Styled on a light warm neutral stone canvas (`#faf8f5`) with high-contrast typography, generous negative space, refined pill buttons, and subtle borders.\n- **Top Window Tab Bar**: Implemented the desktop window control bar with a sidebar toggle, back/forward navigation arrows, multi-session tabs (*Document and Image Analysis*, *AI Agent Tutorial*, *New Chat*), and window management buttons.\n- **Left Navigation Sidebar**:\n  - **Brand & Primary Navigation**: Features the stylized flying bird logo with active item highlight, `New Chat`, `Search`, `Meeting Notes`, and `Routines`.\n  - **Project Directory**: Expandable `\360\237\223\201 ai` project tree with documents, notes, and attached contexts.\n  - **Desktop Status & Profile**: Includes the *Update ready (Version 0.84.17)* restart trigger, toggleable *\342\227\217 Context enabled* engine status, and the user profile card for *gaman sai (Basic)*.\n- **Main Workspace & Prompt Bar**:\n  - Displays the greeting *\"What\'s the next step, gaman?\"* alongside today\'s dynamic date.\n  - Built the prompt container with a `+` attachment drawer, `Max \342\214\265` model selector, live Web Speech microphone voice transcription, and dark circular send button.\n  - Built the **Real Connectors Strip** featuring brand icons for **Dropbox**, **Google Calendar**, **Google Drive**, **Asana**, **Linear**, **Notion**, **Slack**, **Discord**, **Zapier**, and **GitHub**.\n  - Interactive suggestion chips (*How is my data protected?*, *What are your capabilities?*, *Find popular decluttering methods online*, and *\342\234\250 More suggestions*).\n- **Interactive Connector Hub**: Clicking any connector opens a dedicated management modal to trigger live data syncs, view synchronized files and tickets, manage API credentials/OAuth tokens, and search cross-app knowledge items.\n- **Meeting Notes & Autonomous Routines**: Dedicated views for recording live audio transcripts, extracting actionable checkbox commitments, and running automated background agent routines."
