oday, 9:00 AM\",\n        summary: \"Align typography, button shapes, and input containers to Littlebird spec.\",\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"asn-3\",\n        title: \"Gemini 3.7 Flash Model Fallback & Streaming\",\n        type: \"Task (Review)\",\n        updatedAt: \"Yesterday\",\n        summary: \"Benchmarked sub-1s latency for multi-tool context retrieval and search synthesis.\",\n      },\n    ],\n    authFields: [\n      { key: \"asanaToken\", label: \"Personal Access Token\", placeholder: \"1/120...\", type: \"password\" },\n      { key: \"workspace\", label: \"Workspace Name / ID\", placeholder: \"Littlebird Core\", type: \"text\" },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"linear\",\n    name: \"Linear\",\n    category: \"productivity\",\n    icon: \"linear\",\n    brandColor: \"#5E6AD2\",\n    description: \"Sync engineering issues, review sprint cycles, and track project roadmap.\",\n    status: \"connected\",\n    connectedAccount: \"team-littlebird.linear.app\",\n    lastSynced: \"3 mins ago\",\n    itemCount: 19,\n    dataItems: [\n      {\n        id: \"lin-1\",\n        title: \"LIT-104: Streaming markdown code block copy button\",\n        type: \"Linear Issue (In Progress)\",\n        updatedAt: \"Today, 1:15 PM\",\n        summary: \"State: In Progress | Assignee: gaman sai | Estimate: 2 pts\",\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"lin-2\",\n        title: \"LIT-108: Web Speech API continuous dictation handler\",\n        type: \"Linear Issue (Done)\",\n        updatedAt: \"Today, 10:45 AM\",\n        summary: \"State: Done | Reviewer: Alex Rivera | Cycle 24\",\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"lin-3\",\n        title: \"LIT-112: Zero-leakage API key proxy endpoint security\",\n        type: \"Linear Issue (Todo)\",\n        updatedAt: \"Yesterday\",\n        summary: \"State: Todo | Priority: Urgent | Security Hardening\",\n      },\n    ],\n    authFields: [\n      { key: \"linearApiKey\", label: \"Linear API Key\", placeholder: \"lin_api_...\", type: