alendar Event Ends | Action: Generate Asana task checklist\",\n      },\n    ],\n    authFields: [\n      { key: \"zapierNLAKey\", label: \"Zapier Natural Language Actions API Key\", placeholder: \"sk-ak-...\", type: \"password\" },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"github\",\n    name: \"GitHub\",\n    category: \"code\",\n    icon: \"github\",\n    brandColor: \"#24292E\",\n    description: \"Browse repositories, review pull requests, and analyze commit histories.\",\n    status: \"connected\",\n    connectedAccount: \"github.com/vijay-goona (vijay.goona@gmail.com)\",\n    lastSynced: \"4 mins ago\",\n    itemCount: 14,\n    dataItems: [\n      {\n        id: \"gh-1\",\n        title: \"littlebird-ai/workspace-core\",\n        type: \"GitHub Repository\",\n        updatedAt: \"Today (Main branch: commit 9b8c1e)\",\n        summary: \"React 18 + Vite + Tailwind full-stack desktop application architecture.\",\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"gh-2\",\n        title: \"PR #42: Add Real Connectors & Proximity Sidebar\",\n        type: \"Pull Request\",\n        updatedAt: \"Open (2 approvals, passing CI)\",\n        summary: \"Implements genuine connector drawers, hover auto-reveal rail, and user profile dynamic binding.\",\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"gh-3\",\n        title: \"Issue #18: Low-latency Web Speech dictation\",\n        type: \"GitHub Issue\",\n        updatedAt: \"Closed with commit 7a3f2b\",\n        summary: \"Added live interim results and microphone toggle feedback.\",\n      },\n    ],\n    authFields: [\n      { key: \"personalAccessToken\", label: \"GitHub Personal Access Token (classic)\", placeholder: \"ghp_...\", type: \"password\" },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n\nexport const INITIAL_MEETING_NOTES: MeetingNote[] = [\n  {\n    id: \"meet-1\",\n    title: \"AI Agent Swarm Architecture & Connector Integration\",\n    date: \"Wednesday, August 26, 2026\",\n    duration: \"45 mins\",\n    participants: [\"Vijay Goona\", \"Alex Rivera (Lead Arch)\", \"Sarah Chen (Design)\", \"Elena Rostova (Eng)\"],\n    appSource: \"Google Calendar\",\n    summary: \"Finalized the technical specification for real app connectors in Littlebird. Decided on two-way context grounding where prompts can search across Google Drive, Notion, Slack, and Linear concurrently with Gemini 3.7 Flash.\",\n    actionItems: [\n      { id: \"act-1\", task: \"Deploy connector drawer and OAuth credential validator\", assignee: \"Vijay Goona\", completed: true },\n      { id: \"act-2\", task: \"Add browser Web Speech API for voice prompt transcription\", assignee: \"Elena Rostova\", completed: true },\n      { id: \"act-3\", task: \"Design multi-tab window bar matching Littlebird desktop spec\", assignee: \"Sarah Chen\", completed: true },\n      { id: \"act-4\", task: \"Benchmark multi-tool latency under 800ms\", assignee: \"Alex Rivera\", completed: false },\n    ],\n    transcriptSnippet: \"Vijay: Let\'s ensure the user can click any connector icon in the prompt bar and immediately view synced data items or trigger a live refresh. Sarah: The warm beige background and minimalist pill buttons create a calm, focused aesthetic.\",\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"meet-2\",\n    title: \"Weekly Engineering Standup & Sprint Planning\",\n    date: \"Monday, August 24, 2026\",\n    duration: \"30 mins\",\n    participants: [\"Vijay Goona\", \"David Kim\", \"Priya Patel\"],\n    appSource: \"Google Calendar\",\n    summary: \"Reviewed sprint backlog. Assigned Linear issue triage and Notion knowledge base documentation.\",\n    actionItems: [\n      { id: \"act-201\", task: \"Update API endpoint error handlers\", assignee: \"David Kim\", completed: true },\n      { id: \"act-202\", task: \"Document routine automation recipes\", assignee: \"Priya Patel\", completed: false },\n    ],\n    transcriptSnippet: \"David: All server endpoints in server.ts are responding with 200 OK. Priya: The Routine triggers are ready for testing with Zapier and Slack webhooks.\",\n  },\n];\n\nexport const INITIAL_ROUTINES: Routine[] = [\n  {\n    id: \"rt-1\",\n    name: \"Morning Executive Briefing & Calendar Prep\",\n    description: \"Gathers today\'s Google Calendar events, unread Slack priority threads, and Linear blockers to draft a 3-bullet morning briefing.\",\n    schedule: \"Daily at 8:30 AM\",\n    enabled: true,\n    triggerApp: \"Google Calendar\",\n    actionApp: \"Slack / Notion\",\n    lastRun: \"Today, 8:30 AM (Success)\",\n    prompt: \"Scan today\'s calendar events, summarize prep notes from Notion specs, and highlight overdue Linear tickets for my team.\",\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"rt-2\",\n    name: \"Daily Meeting Action Items Extractor\",\n    description: \"Parses meeting transcripts from Google Calendar events, extracts action items, and generates Asana tasks automatically.\",\n    schedule: \"Weekdays at 5:00 PM\",\n    enabled: true,\n    triggerApp: \"Google Meet / Calendar\",\n    actionApp: \"Asana\",\n    lastRun: \"Yesterday, 5:00 PM (Success)\",\n    prompt: \"Analyze transcripts from all completed meetings today, categorize action items with assignees and due dates, and export to Asana.\",\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"rt-3\",\n    name: \"Code Review & PR Triage Digest\",\n    description: \"Monitors GitHub pull requests and Slack mentions, summarizing open PRs waiting for your review.\",\n    schedule: \"Every 4 Hours\",\n    enabled: false,\n    triggerApp: \"GitHub\",\n    actionApp: \"Slack\",\n    lastRun: \"Aug 24, 4:00 PM\",\n    prompt: \"Check GitHub for pending pull requests matching my handle, analyze code diffs, and generate quick summary bullet points.\",\n  },\n];\n\nexport const INITIAL_PROJECTS: ProjectItem[] = [\n  {\n    id: \"proj-ai\",\n    name: \"ai\",\n    type: \"folder\",\n    updatedAt: \"Today, 3:30 PM\",\n    children: [\n      {\n        id: \"doc-1\",\n        name: \"Agent Swarm Architecture Notes.md\",\n        type: \"doc\",\n        updatedAt: \"Today, 2:10 PM\",\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"doc-2\",\n        name: \"Connected Tools & OAuth Config.json\",\n        type: \"doc\",\n        updatedAt: \"Today, 11:20 AM\",\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"chat-ref\",\n        name: \"Document and Image Analysis Session\",\n        type: \"chat\",\n        updatedAt: \"Yesterday\",\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"proj-design\",\n    name: \"design-system\",\n    type: \"folder\",\n    updatedAt: \"Aug 23\",\n    children: [\n      {\n        id: \"doc-3\",\n        name: \"Littlebird Warm Minimalist Tokens.css\",\n        type: \"doc\",\n        updatedAt: \"Aug 23\",\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n"
